    "sections": {
        "description": "WoWmart Organic is a clean and modern WordPress theme designed specifically for organic food stores, natural product shops, health &amp; wellness businesses, and eco-friendly marketplaces. Built with WooCommerce integration, this theme provides a seamless shopping experience with beautiful product displays, intuitive navigation, and responsive design that looks stunning on all devices. Features include customizable layouts, multiple homepage sections, product filters, and easy color customization to match your brand identity. Perfect for farmers markets, organic grocery stores, natural cosmetics shops, and sustainable lifestyle brands looking to establish a professional online presence."
    },
